   ("8","Hobart, TAS","Tasmania's small market is growing; Hobart's loads remain below the mainland capitals."),
   ("9","Regional NSW (Newcastle, Wollongong, Byron)","The strongest regional cocaine consumption in the country — coastal NSW towns track close to capital-city levels."),
