  method="Methodology: ACIC National Wastewater Drug Monitoring Program (Year 9, December 2024–October 2025, 64 sites covering 57% of population) — benzoylecgonine loads by site, combined with state reporting. Rankings combine per-capita loads with absolute market size.",
